title MCP Server Flow

participant "MCP Client" as Client
participant "MCP Server" as Server
participant "JSON-RPC Handler" as RPC
participant "Tool Registry" as Registry
participant "Discovery Tool" as Discovery
participant "Context Tool" as Context
participant "Contract Tool" as Contract
participant "Quality Tool" as Quality
participant "Discovery Pipeline" as Pipeline
participant "Semantic Cache" as Cache

note over Client, Cache: === Server Initialization ===

Client->Server: Connect (stdio or HTTP)
activate Server
Server->Registry: Register tools
Registry->Registry: Load 30+ tools
note right of Registry: Tools:\n- discover_project\n- get_instant_context\n- get_quality_metrics\n- validate_contract\n- suggest_refactoring\n- get_related_files
Registry-->Server: Tool registry ready
Server-->Client: Server initialized

note over Client, Cache: === Tool Discovery ===

Client->Server: tools/list
Server->Registry: Get all tools
Registry-->Server: Tool list
Server->RPC: Format JSON-RPC response
RPC-->Server: Formatted response
Server-->Client: tools/list response

note over Client, Cache: === Tool Execution: discover_project ===

Client->Server: tools/call\n{method: "discover_project",\n params: {projectRoot, intent}}
Server->RPC: Parse JSON-RPC request
RPC->Registry: Get tool handler for "discover_project"
Registry-->RPC: Discovery tool handler
RPC->Discovery: Execute discovery
activate Discovery

Discovery->Discovery: Parse parameters
Discovery->Pipeline: Execute discovery pipeline
activate Pipeline

Pipeline->Pipeline: Architecture detection
Pipeline->Pipeline: Cluster detection
Pipeline->Pipeline: VSLFC discovery (parallel)
Pipeline->Cache: Store artifacts
Cache-->Pipeline: Success
Pipeline-->Discovery: Discovery results
deactivate Pipeline

Discovery->Discovery: Format results
Discovery-->RPC: Tool result
deactivate Discovery
RPC->RPC: Format JSON-RPC response
RPC-->Server: Formatted response
Server-->Client: tools/call response

note over Client, Cache: === Tool Execution: get_instant_context ===

Client->Server: tools/call\n{method: "get_instant_context",\n params: {filePath, task}}
Server->RPC: Parse JSON-RPC request
RPC->Registry: Get tool handler for "get_instant_context"
Registry-->RPC: Context tool handler
RPC->Context: Execute context retrieval
activate Context

Context->Context: Parse parameters
Context->Context: Analyze file/directory
Context->Cache: Query semantic cache
Cache-->Context: Cached artifacts
Context->Context: Generate context
Context->Context: Apply task-aware optimization
Context-->RPC: Context result
deactivate Context
RPC->RPC: Format JSON-RPC response
RPC-->Server: Formatted response
Server-->Client: tools/call response

note over Client, Cache: === Tool Execution: get_quality_metrics ===

Client->Server: tools/call\n{method: "get_quality_metrics",\n params: {module}}
Server->RPC: Parse JSON-RPC request
RPC->Registry: Get tool handler for "get_quality_metrics"
Registry-->RPC: Quality tool handler
RPC->Quality: Execute quality analysis
activate Quality

Quality->Quality: Parse parameters
Quality->Cache: Query semantic cache
Cache-->Quality: Artifacts
Quality->Quality: Calculate cohesion
Quality->Quality: Calculate coupling
Quality->Quality: Calculate complexity
Quality->Quality: Detect code smells
Quality-->RPC: Quality metrics
deactivate Quality
RPC->RPC: Format JSON-RPC response
RPC-->Server: Formatted response
Server-->Client: tools/call response

note over Client, Cache: === Tool Execution: validate_contract ===

Client->Server: tools/call\n{method: "validate_contract",\n params: {layer, module}}
Server->RPC: Parse JSON-RPC request
RPC->Registry: Get tool handler for "validate_contract"
Registry-->RPC: Contract tool handler
RPC->Contract: Execute contract validation
activate Contract

Contract->Contract: Parse parameters
Contract->Cache: Query contract registry
Cache-->Contract: Registry data
Contract->Contract: Validate contracts
Contract->Contract: Check violations
Contract->Contract: Identify gaps
Contract-->RPC: Validation results
deactivate Contract
RPC->RPC: Format JSON-RPC response
RPC-->Server: Formatted response
Server-->Client: tools/call response

note over Client, Cache: === Error Handling ===

alt Tool execution fails
    RPC->RPC: Catch exception
    RPC->RPC: Format error response
    note right of RPC: JSON-RPC error:\n- code: -32603\n- message: "Tool execution failed"\n- data: error details
    Server-->Client: tools/call error response
else Invalid request
    RPC->RPC: Validate request
    RPC->RPC: Format error response
    note right of RPC: JSON-RPC error:\n- code: -32600\n- message: "Invalid request"\n- data: validation errors
    Server-->Client: tools/call error response
end

note over Client, Cache: === Server Shutdown ===

Client->Server: Close connection
Server->Server: Cleanup resources
Server->Registry: Unregister tools
Server-->Client: Connection closed
deactivate Server
